I realize this is a fairly long episode,

02:29:47.670 --> 02:29:49.620
that is intentional.

02:29:49.620 --> 02:29:51.780
Much like our episode on ADHD,

02:29:51.780 --> 02:29:54.180
on attention deficit
hyperactivity disorder,

02:29:54.180 --> 02:29:56.310
I received an enormous number of requests

02:29:56.310 --> 02:29:59.190
to talk about OCD, and
my decision to make this

02:29:59.190 --> 02:30:03.000
a very long and detailed episode about OCD

02:30:03.000 --> 02:30:04.650
really doesn't stem from any desire

02:30:04.650 --> 02:30:07.590
to subject you to too much information

02:30:07.590 --> 02:30:11.610
or to avoid the opportunity
to just list things off,

02:30:11.610 --> 02:30:13.590
but what I've tried to
provide is an opportunity

02:30:13.590 --> 02:30:15.807
to really drill deep
into the neural circuitry

02:30:15.807 --> 02:30:18.420
and an understanding of
where OCD comes from,

02:30:18.420 --> 02:30:20.790
how OCD is different from things like

02:30:20.790 --> 02:30:22.950
the personality disorders
that I described.

02:30:22.950 --> 02:30:26.850
And also to give you a
sense of how the individual

02:30:26.850 --> 02:30:28.410
behavioral and drug treatments work

02:30:28.410 --> 02:30:29.940
and perhaps don't work

02:30:29.940 --> 02:30:32.490
so that you can really make
the best informed choices,

02:30:32.490 --> 02:30:34.620
again, highlighting the fact that OCD

02:30:34.620 --> 02:30:37.830
is an extremely common, extremely common,

02:30:37.830 --> 02:30:40.440
and yet extremely debilitating condition

02:30:40.440 --> 02:30:42.450
and one that I hope
that if any of you have,

02:30:42.450 --> 02:30:44.010
or that you know people that have it

02:30:44.010 --> 02:30:46.950
that you'll both gain
sympathy and understanding

02:30:46.950 --> 02:30:48.180
for what they're dealing with,

02:30:48.180 --> 02:30:49.190
perhaps as a consequence of some

02:30:49.190 --> 02:30:51.060
of the information presented today,

02:30:51.060 --> 02:30:54.630
and maybe help them
direct their treatment,

02:30:54.630 --> 02:30:56.940
find better treatment, and of course,

02:30:56.940 --> 02:30:59.220
apply those treatments for some relief.

